  "markdown": "# Peta Learning Outcomes dan Cara Belajar\n\n> [!info] Sumber: syllabus resmi di Binusmaya (LMS), dibaca 20 Oktober 2026\n> BUSS6223005, kelas LK24, 2 SKS. Dosen: Dr. Birka Septy Meliany Br Sembiring, S.E., M.Si. (syllabus); materi disampaikan oleh Damar Aji Irawan, S.Hum., M.Sc.\n\n## Penilaian\n| Komponen | Bobot |\n|---|---|\n| Assignment | 20% (AI limited) |\n| Mid exam | 30%, jadwal 2 November 2026 |\n| Final project | 50% |\n\n## 3 Learning Outcome\n| LO | Level | Isi | Indikator rubrik |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| LO1 | C4 Analysis | Analyze a business perspective on Asia trade and policies and how recent issues affect trade in Asia | 1.1 perspektif bisnis perdagangan Asia; 1.2 kebijakan perdagangan Asia; 1.3 pengaruh isu terkini |\n| LO2 | C4 Analysis | Identify export-import market in Asia | 2.1 pasar target ekspor untuk produk terpilih; 2.2 pasar target impor |\n| LO3 | C5 Synthesis | Write an export marketing plan and export market analysis for selected Asian countries | 3.1 export marketing plan; 3.2 export market analysis |\n\n## Peta sesi\n| Sesi | Judul | LO |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 | Globalization of Trade | LO1 |\n| 2 | Export-Import Overview (syarat eksportir, Incoterms) | LO1, LO2 |\n| 3 | Export-Import Correspondence (surat, kontrak, CISG) | LO2, LO3 |\n| 4 | Export Market Analysis (ITC tools, penyaringan pasar) | LO2, LO3 |\n| 5 | Case Study 1 (ekspor konten Jepang dan Korea) | LO1 |\n| 6 | Trading with ASEAN | LO1, LO2 |\n| 7 | Trading with Japan | LO1, LO2 |\n| 8 | Trading with South Korea | LO1, LO2 |\n| 9 | Case Study 2 | LO1 |\n| 10 | Trading with India | LO1, LO2 |\n| 11 | Trading with China | LO1, LO2 |\n| 12 | Export Marketing Plan | LO3 |\n| 13 | Digital Services Trade in Asia | LO1 |\n\n## Cara belajar\nMid exam (2 Nov) paling mungkin mencakup sesi awal. Kuasai dulu konsep inti: balance of trade, determinan ekspor, syarat eksportir Indonesia, Incoterms 2020, kontrak ekspor, dan lima tahap penyaringan pasar. Tanyakan dosen cakupan pastinya."
